        text: "Agent Zero's main web interface. Conversational chat with the agent, message history and configuration panel.",
        visual: '1',
      },
      {
        title: 'General settings',
        text: 'Configuration of prompts, memory and knowledge directories. The agent can read and write files to persist its context.',
        visual: '2',
      },
