        title: 'Chat Models configuration',
        text: 'Selection of the main model, utility model and web browser model. Each model has its own role.',
        visual: '4',
      },
      {
        title: 'API Keys',
        text: 'API key management for OpenRouter and Google Gemini. All credentials centralized in one interface.',
        visual: '10',
      },
      {
        title: 'Error 402 — insufficient credits',
        text: 'First test with OpenRouter: 402 Payment Required error. Free models have been removed, payment is now required.',
        visual: '12',
      },
      {
        title: 'Gemini operational',
        text: 'After configuring Google Gemini (free API key), the agent correctly responds to a simple greeting.',
        visual: '13',
      },
      {
        title: 'Code generation — Flappy Bird',
        text: "Instruction: 'Create a Flappy Bird game'. The agent generated complete HTML, CSS and JavaScript, ready to use.",
        visual: '14',
      },
      {
        title: 'Functional game',
        text: 'The Flappy Bird game runs directly in the browser, with keyboard controls, score and game over.',
        visual: '15',
      },
      {
        title: 'Detailed logs',
        text: 'Logs section to diagnose API calls, quota errors and model response times.',
        visual: '16',
      },
      {
        title: 'Files section',
        text: 'View of files created by the agent in the container: games, scripts, notes. Persistence of creations.',
        visual: '17',
      },
      {
        title: 'System Stats',
        text: 'Real-time monitoring: CPU, memory and storage usage. Useful to anticipate container crashes.',
        visual: '18',
      },
      {
        title: 'Flappy Bird — screenshot',
        text: 'Screenshot of the game generated by the agent. A real playable game with clean, commented code.',
        visual: '19',
      },
    ]}
    process={[
      {
        step: 'Step 01',
        title: 'Docker deployment',
        description:
          'Launch of the frdel/agent-zero-run:latest container on Kali Linux. Ports 80 (web) and 22 (SSH) exposed, services managed by Supervisor.',
      },
      {
        step: 'Step 02',
        title: 'OpenRouter configuration',
        description:
          'Adding the OpenRouter API key. First test failed with 402 error: free models have been removed, credits are required.',
      },
      {
        step: 'Step 03',
        title: 'Migration to Gemini',
        description:
          'Switching provider to Google Gemini. Free API key via Google AI Studio, gemini-3.6-flash model, 8000 token window.',
      },
      {
        step: 'Step 04',
        title: 'Model configuration',
        description:
          'Chat Model, Utility Model and Web Browser Model configured on Gemini. Context management to stay within free quotas.',
      },
      {
        step: 'Step 05',
